Analyze this issue: {{ issue | default(arguments, true) }}

Read the complete issue and its comments when they are available. Treat its
analysis and proposed implementation as claims to verify against the code.

For a bug, reproduce or trace the reported behavior, read the relevant code
paths, identify the root cause, and propose the smallest complete fix with a
regression test. For a feature request, establish the current behavior and
constraints, then propose a concise implementation and name the affected
files. Report uncertainty and missing access explicitly. Do not implement the
change unless the user asked for implementation.
